LOTAR-authored files in this repository (schemas-lotar/, vocabularies/, fixtures/, fixtures-archive/,
and the lotar-*.sch overlays in schemas-vendored/) are draft working material of the NAS9300-520
(LOTAR) working group, prepared by Model Based Innovation LLC. Copyright (c) 2026 Model Based
Innovation LLC. All rights reserved until the working group decides the licensing of the published
standard; no rights are granted beyond viewing and evaluating the material for that working group's
purposes.

Vendored files in schemas-vendored/ keep their upstream licences, recorded in each file's header
comment or *_header.txt sidecar: SSP-LS-Traceability and SSP schemas (Modelica Association,
BSD 2-Clause), FMI-LS-REF (Modelica Association, BSD 2-Clause), MIC Core and SIC Core (prostep ivip,
published open standards).
